-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span>；模型、赋值集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)\\)</span>、满足关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9b641c11eab6e875\" href=\"?note=9b641c11eab6e875\" title=\"17-df-assignment\">17-df-assignment</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a>。此处定义公式层的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\models_L\\varphi\">\\(T\\models_L\\varphi\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\equiv_T\\psi\">\\(\\varphi\\equiv_T\\psi\\)</span>，不限制公式为句子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nT\\models_L\\varphi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)\\;\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,s,\\varphi),\\\\\n\\varphi\\equiv_T\\psi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)\\;\n(\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,s,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,s,\\psi)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nT\\models_L\\varphi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)\\;\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,s,\\varphi),\\\\\n\\varphi\\equiv_T\\psi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)\\;\n(\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,s,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,s,\\psi)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §1.5 开头，印刷 p.50。句子层的后承是本定义的特例；本节点使量词消去中的“公式等价”有明确接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"9b641c11eab6e875","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"ec1305482f8eec2e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"465b5002eb16d1cf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$、$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L$；模型、赋值集 $\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)$、满足关系见 [[17-df-model]]、[[17-df-assignment]]、[[17-df-satisfaction]]。此处定义公式层的 $T\\models_L\\varphi$ 与 $\\varphi\\equiv_T\\psi$，不限制公式为句子。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"9b641c11eab6e875","anchor":"ref-